  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For Infinite many solution&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />i.e ,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mo>&#955;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#955;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#955;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mo>&#955;</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0&#160;</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></math>&nbsp;is strictly increasing</p><p>i.e., equation has only one real root,<br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Only one value of <math><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is possible</p>",
